          "latency_s": 46.281,
          "answer": "According to the context, the following OV-600S requirements are still not met:\n\n1. Descaling: The requirement of at least 150 cycles before descaling is not met with hard water [ECR-0123, TR-2026-058, SPEC-OV600-001].\n2. Preheat time: The preheat time is still 0.1 minutes above the 7.5 minute limit [MEET-2026-09-10, TR-2026-066].\n3. Hinge durability: The hinge durability is still open, waiting for ECR-0126 samples [MEET-2026-09-10].\n\nNote that the requirement of 150 cycles at 3.5 mmol/l cannot be met by software alone and a larger generator or a scale filter must be evaluated, or the requirement must be reviewed [ECR-0123]."
