          "latency_s": 60.431,
          "answer": "Based on the provided context, the following change requests are still open or in review:\n\n1. ECR-0117: Fan noise (closed, but OV-600P is still waiting for ECR-0125 samples) [MEET-2026-09-10]\n2. ECR-0125: Door temperature during pyrolysis (waiting for samples) [MEET-2026-09-10]\n3. ECR-0121: Uniformity and energy (closed, but OV-600S still has open points) [MEET-2026-09-10]\n4. ECR-0123: Water-hardness-based descaling counter (open points) [ECR-0123]\n5. ECR-0126: Hinge durability (open) [MEET-2026-09-10]\n\nAdditionally, the following change requests are still in review or have open points:\n\n1. ECR-0121: Uniformity and energy (closed, but OV-600S still has open points) [MEET-2026-09-10]\n2. ECR-0123: Water-hardness-based descaling counter (open points) [ECR-0123]\n3. ECR-0126: Hinge durability (open) [MEET-2026-09-10]\n\nNote that ECR-0117 is technically closed, but OV-600P is still waiting for ECR-0125 samples, so it's not fully resolved."
